  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of MSB&apos;s contribution is to support the organization in carrying out its mandate. Overall, MSB&apos;s contribution should result in;
(i) The receiving organization can quickly coordinate the necessary resources for the missions through ensured HQ capacity to plan, prioritize, implement and develop the in-depth support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xd6;vergripande ska MSB:s bidrag resultera i; 
(i) Mottagande organisation snabbt kan samordna n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga resurser till missionerna genom s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lld HQ kapacitet att planera, prioritera, genomf&#xf6;ra samt utveckla det insatsn&#xe4;ra st&#xf6;det.</narrative>
